{"title":"2007 SMT Algebra Round Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_SMT_Algebra_Round_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/e/0bee287860212f856a220d6beb054bd5df5c1a2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(x^{\\frac19}\\right)=x^2-3x-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"173\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_SMT_Algebra_Round_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>After factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/5/b6545980000454dcb9d3a4ca36c9a6ffd01a86eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(x^{\\frac19}\\right)=(x-1)(x+4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"194\" height=\"34\" />, so to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494d07cb91026af880f6dec49737eb9f0d5959b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x+4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, so, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/b/d6ba5ee558cab0d0702e64ea08960f51afa8debc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"19\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/a/d6a3f66575c802089c04de7507319ba906e429ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^{\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" />, and because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/b/d6ba5ee558cab0d0702e64ea08960f51afa8debc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"19\" /> can't be simplified and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/2266acd58191914b0b4da124365b340da774075c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)^{\\frac19}=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"24\" />, our answer is roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/2/ce2bbde9040e87712464554ee7d53d8cb22b2f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\mathrm{4^{\\frac19} \\text{ or } -1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"109\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018053503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 42/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2061/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:34727:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018053503 and revision id 264398. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}